+# Vellum cursor artwork notice
+
+The SVGs in this prepared fork's cursors/svg directory are original geometric
+Vellum artwork, copyright (c) 2026 Davin Hills, provided under the adjacent
+LICENSE_VELLUM.txt (MIT). They replace all 39 prior built-in SVGs. The same original zoom-in artwork also
+replaces the duplicated SVG regression fixture at svg/testdata/svg/zoom-in.svg. Hotspots and
+hashes are recorded in owned-assets.json. The Vellum source contains the
+reproducible generator and exact pinned overlay inputs.
+
+The cursor Go code retains its Cogent Core BSD copyright and license. Other
+module assets and dependencies retain their own declarations. This notice is
+specific to the replacement SVG artwork and grants no rights over other assets.
+
+CPU raster checks cover both schemes, five sizes and primary-geometry hotspots.
+They do not establish physical-pointer behavior, native cursor lifetime cleanup,
+or full Mac distribution approval. Those remain separate acceptance gates.
